MultiRigidBodyTracker.py
 
Python port of MultiRigidBodyTracker.m (MATLAB/NatNet multi-Rigid-Body
tracker for OptiTrack Motive), preserving the same analysis pipeline:
Kinematics, Relative Motion / Safety, Tracking Quality, Static-body
detection, Latency, Figures, and a Dashboard -- saved into a MocapSession
